    "input": "search_document: Based on the handbook excerpts provided, here is the information regarding your questions about the Northwind Outdoor Loyalty Program:\n\n**Elite Tier Requirements**\nYes, you are correct. To unlock Elite status, you must accumulate **5,000 points** within a rolling **12-month period** [loyalty_program_5]. It is based on points, not just a specific dollar amount, though points are earned based on spending. As a Standard member, you earn 1 point for every $1.00 spent on eligible items [loyalty_program_2]. Therefore, to reach Elite status, you would generally need to spend $5,000 on eligible items within that 12-month window (assuming you are not already earning bonus points) [loyalty_program_2][loyalty_program_5].\n\n**Point Expiration**\nYes, points do expire. Loyalty points are valid for **12 months** from the date they were earned [loyalty_program_3]. For example, points earned on January 15, 2024, would expire on January 14, 2025 [loyalty_program_3]. The handbook does not mention \"free shipping\" as a specific benefit of the Elite tier or the program in general; the listed benefits for Elite members are a 10% bonus on points earned and early access to new product launches [loyalty_program_5].\n\n**Tracking and Earning Points**\n*   **Eligible Items:** You earn points on bikes, camping gear, accessories, and apparel sold directly by Northwind Outdoor [loyalty_program_2].\n*   **Exclusions:** Points are **not** earned on gift cards, store credit, or items marked with a \"No Points\" clearance tag [loyalty_program_2].\n*   **Timing:** Points are credited to your account within 24 hours of the order being shipped [loyalty_program_2].\n*   **Redemption:** You can redeem points for discounts at a rate of 100 points = $5.00 off [loyalty_program_4].\n\n**Recommendation**\nSince you are planning to buy a bike and camping gear, these items are eligible for points [loyalty_program_2]. To ensure you track your points correctly, I recommend checking your account dashboard monthly to monitor your balance and the expiration dates of your oldest points [loyalty_program_3].\n\n*Note: The handbook excerpts provided do not contain information regarding free shipping benefits. If free shipping is a specific concern, I can offer to escalate your ticket to a human agent for clarification on that specific policy.*",
    "model": "nomic-embed-text",
